{"id":"d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05","cat":"counsel","group":{"id":"char5138","label":"Mihara: Bonding Chain"},"label":"Mihara: Bonding Chain's Memories: 05","stage":null,"prev":"d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_04","next":"d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_06","speakers":{"mihara":"Mihara","mihara_b":"Mihara"},"icons":{"mihara":"si_c161_00_s","mihara_b":"si_c162_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_1","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_1","text":"From the haze of her memory, Mihara recalls a counseling session with someone she misses dearly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CommanderRoom","bgArt":"commanderroom","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_areah","movie":null,"shown":["mihara"],"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_2","text":"I bumped into someone earlier, and I enjoyed the feeling of our shoulders smacking into each other.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_3","text":"I thanked them, and they looked really flustered.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_4","text":"What should I have said instead?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_5","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_5","text":"You should have apologized.","jump":"d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_7","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_100"},{"id":"d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_6","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_6","text":"There's nothing wrong with saying, \"Thank you.\"","jump":"d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_10","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_120"},{"id":"d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara_b","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_7","text":"I realize that for most people, bumping into another person is an unpleasant experience, and so you apologize.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CityForest_01","bgArt":"cityforest_01","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["mihara_b"],"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara_b","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_8","text":"But for me, it was such a pleasant sensation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara_b","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_9","text":"Even now, thinking back on it, I'm not sure what else I could have said to them.","jump":"d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_12","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara_b","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_10","text":"That's what I thought! I'm grateful to them, and so I'm thanking them. I shouldn't have to say anything else.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CityForest_01","bgArt":"cityforest_01","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["mihara_b"],"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara_b","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_11","text":"Hehe, I can't believe there's someone out there who understands me so well.","jump":"d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_12","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_12","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mihara_bondingchain_05_12","text":"Mihara smiles as she imagines bumping shoulders with someone else.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"none","bgArt":"none","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"}]}